[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558064933","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100690#issuecomment-2558064933","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100690","id":2558064933,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YePkl","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T09:35:15Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T09:35:15Z","body":"`hide_from_dialog` sounds too specific to me, like too bound to the current editor UX. I'd suggest something more abstract, conveying something like 'hidden from UI', 'not selectable', etc. Is there maybe a possibility of having an annotation to mark the class as internal, leveraging what the class DB already provides? Maybe not possible or fitting, but I wanted to point out possible alternative approaches.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558064933/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558068361","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100690#issuecomment-2558068361","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100690","id":2558068361,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YeQaJ","user":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T09:49:29Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T09:49:45Z","body":"> `hide_from_dialog` sounds too specific to me, like too bound to the current editor UX. I'd suggest something more abstract, conveying something like 'hidden from UI', 'not selectable', etc.\r\n\r\nYep this annotation only affects the behavior in the create dialog, and imo if some words like `@hidden` or `@not_selectable` is resorted to, the meaning would be inaccurate: How this script will be hidden? How will this script being non-selectable be? Personally, although `@hide_from_dialog` sounds specific, it conveys more direct, accurate to the users what this annotation wants to express and what effect(s) the annotation will take on this script.\r\nIn my perspective I don't advocate using unclear or abstract word for a more conceptual and you-know-what-it-is thing.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558068361/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558087224","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100690#issuecomment-2558087224","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100690","id":2558087224,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YeVA4","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T11:17:21Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T11:17:21Z","body":"I think this doesn't just sound to specific, I think it is to specific to be an annotation. If we add an annotation for every slight tweak that could be made to the current UI, we will end up with too much annotations in the long run. \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11238 isn't an issue that is brought up frequently (AFAIK), would be great to find a good solution, but adding two new annotations for it feels like a kind of annotation inflation to me. (Meaning it decreases the average impact that an annotation has and thus raises total annotations, I don't think this is desirable.)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558087224/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558090337","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100690#issuecomment-2558090337","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100690","id":2558090337,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YeVxh","user":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T11:32:27Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T11:32:27Z","body":"> I think this doesn't just sound to specific, I think it is to specific to be an annotation. If we add an annotation for every slight tweak that could be made to the current UI, we will end up with too much annotations in the long run.\r\n> \r\n> [godotengine/godot-proposals#11238](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11238) isn't an issue that is brought up frequently (AFAIK), would be great to find a good solution, but adding two new annotations for it feels like a kind of annotation inflation to me. (Meaning it decreases the average impact that an annotation has and thus raises total annotations, I don't think this is desirable.)\r\n\r\n(Will be off-topic) The problem is that the script cannot serialize and store metadata. Storing the metadata of a script may require a new file, but the crux is in which way this should be implemented. At least adding any redundant dangling file would be a worse practice. Meanwhile, it's also important to make it easy-moved, i.e. if you move it to another directory, it still works without users editing `.godot` or `.uid` file. `.gdmeta` is the best practice for this, but as i said that is a future beam.\r\n(On-topic) I'm currently thinking of adding special comments beginning with `#meta: xxxx = []`, but not sure if parsing it would be a hacky process...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558090337/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558103997","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100690#issuecomment-2558103997","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100690","id":2558103997,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YeZG9","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T12:19:14Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T12:19:57Z","body":"There are already two PRs with an annotation to hide a class from editor dialogs:\r\n\r\n* #91020\r\n* #95806\r\n\r\nIn this case, introducing an annotation looks ok to me, although I'm not sure about the semantics (should it be something specific like `@hide_from_editor` or general like `@internal`). Retroactively, it would have been better to initially split this functionality into two keywords/annotations to avoid exclusive logic. But now this would break compatibility.\r\n\r\nRegarding the suffix, I agree with HolonProduction and commented in the linked proposal that in my opinion the annotation for the suffix is ​​too specific to appear at the language level. And maybe the ability to customize \"suffix\" is not a problem to be solved at all.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558103997/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558117477","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100690#issuecomment-2558117477","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100690","id":2558117477,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YecZl","user":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T13:06:06Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T13:06:06Z","body":"I completely forgot what i said:\r\n\r\n> As what i said above I personally do not prefer adding scripting element to solve the problem\r\n\r\nWell... I think I'd better keep what I said...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558117477/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,